mlx-serve
https://github.com/ddalcu/mlx-serve
Copyright (c) 2026 David Dalcu
Licensed under the MIT License.

src/mlx_serve/ (generated by scripts/prepare.sh, not committed) holds the files of mlx-serve's src/ this plugin compiles,
at their mlx-serve paths, from the commit in MLX_SERVE_REF: the slices scripts/slice.txt (the model, and the engine's
DSpark round helpers the drafter runs) and scripts/slice-stream.txt (the expert streamer) name, with the Metal kernels
and other files they embed, the read pool's C (sdk/weights/streamed/csrc/q3_lookahead4_exl3.c, q3_lookahead4.h) and the
command-buffer timeline's shim a profile build links (sdk/weights/streamed/csrc/dsv41_cb_timeline.mm, .h).
overlay/mlx_serve/ is copied over it: the files in the script's EDGES list, which are this plugin's own code at
mlx-serve paths, not copies. patches/turboexl3.patch then edits the copies (the EXL3 arm and the drafter's switches),
and the other patches/*.patch after it in name order (fixes, a diagnostic, the stage profiler's hooks, the fused Markov
chain's hook, the decode lookahead's setting); the patches are this plugin's.

src/host_shims.zig stands in for mlx-serve's sdk/weights/streamed/csrc/mlx_event_shim.cpp, mlx_alloc_shim.cpp,
mlx_launch_cache.inc and q3_event_shim.mm (their C symbols, over the server's host table), and src/tl_buffer.m for
dsv41_tl_mlx.cpp (the command buffer the timeline's shim hooks, in profile builds); they are this plugin's code.

