mlx-serve absorbed mlx-stream into its server (mlx-serve's NOTICE at MLX_SERVE_REF: "Absorbed from mlx-stream ..., built
into the macOS server"). Of what src/mlx_serve/ copies from mlx-serve, that is: the SSD expert streamer, its SDK and C
shims (sdk/weights/streamed/, module `mlx_stream`: scripts/slice-stream.txt) and the DeepSeek-V4.1 EXL3 decoder with
its pinned Metal kernels (sdk/quant/exl3/stream/). The streaming runtime they were ported from (the packed expert record
and manifest formats, the streamed-bank layout and the routed-expert EXL3 Metal kernels) is David Tai's earlier work.
mlx-serve's NOTICE carries mlx-stream's full entry, with what mlx-stream itself incorporates (MLX, ExLlamaV3,
DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash).

